    "body": "Seems not:\r\n```\r\n❯ cargo run -- init bash | coreutils cat -A\r\nM-oM-;M-?^M$\r\n            __main() {^M$\r\n                local major=\"${BASH_VERSINFO[0]}\"^M$\r\n                local minor=\"${BASH_VERSINFO[1]}\"^M$\r\n^M$\r\n                if ((major > 4)) || { ((major == 4)) && ((minor >= 1)); }; then^M$\r\n                    source <(\"C:\\Users\\david\\Documents\\GitHub\\starshippppp\\target\\debug\\starship.exe\" init bash --print-full-init)^M$\r\n                else^M$\r\n                    source /dev/stdin <<<\"$(\"C:\\Users\\david\\Documents\\GitHub\\starshippppp\\target\\debug\\starship.exe\" init bash --print-full-init)\"^M$\r\n                fi^M$\r\n            }^M$\r\n            __main^M$\r\n            unset -f __main^M$\r\n            ^M$\r\n```",
